  ;; ============================================================
  ;; DESIGN RULES (custom for this board)
  ;; ============================================================
  ;; Track widths:
  ;;   - Signal: 0.25mm (10 mil)
  ;;   - Power: 0.5mm (20 mil) for 1A, 1.0mm (40 mil) for 1.5A
  ;; Via sizes:
  ;;   - Signal: 0.5mm drill, 0.8mm pad
  ;;   - Power: 0.8mm drill, 1.2mm pad
  ;;   - Thermal: 0.3mm drill, 0.6mm pad (under QFN)
  ;; Clearances:
  ;;   - Signal-to-signal: 0.2mm (8 mil)
  ;;   - Signal-to-power: 0.3mm (12 mil)
  ;;   - Power-to-power: 0.4mm (16 mil)
  ;; Impedance control:
  ;;   - 50Ω single-ended (clock, JTAG)
  ;;   - 90Ω differential (USB)

